You may not set the directory where the application is executed, but you may use relative paths to access files in your bundle.
There is currently no persistent storage for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> (http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/Storage.html), but it is something we will add in the future.

